{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1064248/block/singleImage/3269843/df/01M7MCDH3FYJV8VNFCYDB7J9KM.jpg?updatedAt=1794907042\"/><p>聖誕心思思想飛轉台北？即日起至12月3日，香港國際機場網上商店推出「飛悅啟程」優惠。顧客於機場網店 HKairportShop.com 消費滿$3,800，即可免費獲贈星宇航空香港往返台北機票，各位不妨把握機會，將心水好物與台北旅程帶回家。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1064248/block/singleImage/3269857/df/01M7MCGKT186DDKSRB8ZXZCR8R.jpg?updatedAt=1794907042\"/><figcaption>即日起至12月3日，香港國際機場網上商店推出「飛悅啟程」優惠。</figcaption></figure><p>滿額即送機票 毋須抽獎！ 活動期間，網店會員於HKairportShop.com消費滿指定金額，毋須抽獎，即送來回機票一套，享受星宇航空優質的機上服務。網店匯集多個品牌，涵蓋BVLGARI、Duty Zero by cdf Prestige、IWC Schaffhausen及Tiffany &amp; Co.，一次過滿足所有掃貨願望。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T07:27:40.601622+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":317,"images":2,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T06:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T17:17:37.495342+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T07:21:00.394188+00:00","content_hash":"6e1298fc002f63f7f46196fc5db1aaecb7d1bc5d39fd54ebd498b87557b93071","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T07:27:40.601622+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}